{
  "slug": "gorealo-agent-app-intro",
  "name": "GoRealo — Agent technology",
  "description": "Subject: Your client tools, ready when you are | Preheader: See the GoRealo tools designed to support real estate professionals.",
  "type": "email",
  "builder": "mailpurse",
  "html_content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Your client tools, ready when you are</title></head><body style=\"margin:0;background:#f1f4f8;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all\">See the GoRealo tools designed to support real estate professionals.</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#f1f4f8\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:24px 12px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"600\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#fff\"><tr><td style=\"padding:24px 30px;border-top:5px solid #0BFF56\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/gorealo-logo.png\" width=\"154\" alt=\"GoRealo\" style=\"display:block;width:154px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0\"></a><p style=\"margin:9px 0 0;color:#667085;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px\">MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:30px;background:#f0f5ff\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 12px;color:#003FDA;font-size:11px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px\">TOOLS FOR AGENTS</p><h1 style=\"font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 16px;color:#162849\">Keep the next client conversation moving.</h1><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#374151;margin:0 0 14px\">Hi {{first_name}}, GoRealo’s agent tools are designed to help you support clients through their homebuying journey. Take a look and see whether they fit the way you work.</p><p style=\"font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#162849;font-weight:bold;margin:0\">Which part of the client process would you like to simplify?</p><p style=\"margin:20px 0 0\"><img src=\"https://app.gorealo.org/email-template-previews/gorealo/assets/agent-tools.png\" alt=\"GoRealo: Agent technology\" width=\"540\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:540px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:22px 30px\"><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Useful marketing resources</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Explore tools and materials that can help you keep client conversations organized.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">A connected homebuying journey</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Give clients an easy way to learn about mortgage options as they plan their next move.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e5eaf1\"><h2 style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.35;margin:0 0 7px;color:#162849\">Find your fit</h2><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#4b5563;margin:0\">Every team works differently. Explore the app and decide which features are relevant to you.</p></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151;margin:22px 0\">Reply with a workflow you’re working on and we can point you to a relevant tool or resource.</p><p style=\"font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:#374151\">Warmly,<br><strong>The GoRealo Team</strong></p><table role=\"presentation\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"margin:22px 0\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#003FDA\" style=\"border-radius:4px\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold\">Explore agent tools</a></td></tr></table><p style=\"font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\">Prefer to talk? Call <a href=\"tel:+18667139292\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">1-866-713-9292</a> or reply to this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:20px 30px;background:#f4f6f9\"><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085;margin:0\">GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434.<br>5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256.<br>Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply.</p><p style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.7;color:#667085\"><a href=\"https://www.gorealo.com/privacy-policy/\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"{{unsubscribe_url}}\" style=\"color:#003FDA\">Unsubscribe</a></p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
  "plain_text_content": "Your client tools, ready when you are See the GoRealo tools designed to support real estate professionals. MORTGAGE OPTIONS, MADE CLEAR TOOLS FOR AGENTS Keep the next client conversation moving. Hi {{first_name}}, GoRealo’s agent tools are designed to help you support clients through their homebuying journey. Take a look and see whether they fit the way you work. Which part of the client process would you like to simplify? Useful marketing resources Explore tools and materials that can help you keep client conversations organized. A connected homebuying journey Give clients an easy way to learn about mortgage options as they plan their next move. Find your fit Every team works differently. Explore the app and decide which features are relevant to you. Reply with a workflow you’re working on and we can point you to a relevant tool or resource. Warmly, The GoRealo Team Explore agent tools Prefer to talk? Call 1-866-713-9292 or reply to this email. GoRealo® is a DBA of Consumer Credit Services, LLC. NMLS #1070755 · Florida Mortgage Broker License #MBR1434. 5011 Gate Parkway Bldg 100, Suite 100, Jacksonville, FL 32256. Equal Housing Opportunity. Credit, collateral, eligibility, and program terms apply. Privacy · Unsubscribe",
